            <div xml:id="d948">

                <pb facs="0885" n="875" sameAs="frus:frus1941v05/pg875"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">793.94/16566: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in Japan</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Grew</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1941-04-12T14:00:00-05:00">April 12, 1941—2
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>227. Kunming’s 8, April 9, 10 a.m.<anchor n="27" xml:id="d948-f1"/> Please bring
                    emphatically to the attention of the Japanese Foreign Office in such manner as
                    you may deem appropriate the endangering of American lives by this
                    indiscriminate bombing of Kunming. In so doing you may wish to point out that
                    American citizens, including American officials, reside in that city for the
                    purpose of carrying on legitimate activities and are entitled to reside there
                    without danger of attack by Japanese air forces. You may care also to refer to
                    the fact that the lives of American citizens continue to be jeopardized and
                    American citizens continue to suffer loss from such bombings notwithstanding the
                    fact that in most cases the Japanese authorities have been given detailed
                    information with regard to the location of American property and the residences
                    of American citizens.<anchor n="28" xml:id="d948-f2"/>
                </p>
                <p>Sent to Tokyo via Shanghai. Repeated to Chungking, Peiping.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
